Modifications and extensions by Nantaphat Yoktaworn:
- Physical modular tangible block architecture and CH32V003 single-wire bus hardware specification.
- Node-RED palette ('node-red-contrib-robosen-block') implementing 2-phase binary protocol with CRC-8.
- Native Python BLE subsystem, background daemons, and interactive joint kinematics safeguard controllers.
- Custom actions, posture calibration, and telemetry synchronization for Robosen biped robotics.
